{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1490,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c388fa3ae9732521de289b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难道说新宇宙是「微中子」吗……？\r\n贯穿了自动门的传感器……\r\n导致门没开……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1537390db6f14eceda1053841e368a76e4a90f923607c5ae0b0309541d2e6920",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599d0b4965f624943002911e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装简称SF……有点不可思议？\r\n或许真是如此。毕竟穿上后会让我\r\n感到「雀跃」，真是不可思议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "179dd116e105891319d75ca14d14bcd1454020a72e7508ead2a41e227ad610aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68815fc40e9c3aa129681a11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像彗星一样。拖着尾巴向前飞奔。\r\n在舞台上留下轨迹，绽放光芒。\r\n尽管有些相遇此生只会有一次……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3896663d2442eceba7504f695d0a041a82def48bad09a66d80e319cf49e9960",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d54cb614967fbf65e35724f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装的设计灵感来自太空飞行员喔。\r\n纵然得以「对话」的存在身处\r\n辽阔的宇宙，我也要前去见面……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a5af19c24da5eeb0a4c48ad32d8c6ba7b990da51e659217f07fc24f5154787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09d20c02eb395cef0172b80f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经过计算，这内搭跟外套都是\r\n最佳设计。至于为何要发光……\r\n算是为了容易「被找到」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f09ee191203203db83ec2afe85874007fd6fa901f59f8d7391c760c29b3d790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea6e3b2cf3bcc02741ffba7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "否定……感到「昏昏沉沉」。\r\n氧气供应不……呼啊～啊。\r\n……失礼了。刚刚「补充」完毕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9feac70767c3852490e88fdff47e9cba1415948e19a3823ee2e6ed5d5326b72b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1efdfcb08f595fe101d54769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调理包、便携食品、果冻饮料。\r\n发明者真「伟大」。高效率。\r\n我老是「嘴馋」，帮了我很大的忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8229fad99b7714c22b1c3b353dcb17d4aa718a677cf7d5f3353ca2ae11eb650c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbae8b505be24be3c68de85d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地球正朝着「早晨」自转喔。\r\n道声晚安，面向太阳时再见。\r\n星星的低语能带来「安宁」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30eb6f326792558f49a37c7b45a9ab5ca6446780ae72c83f408353e8b8574088",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5627ba5c4c520d3e607bbf76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哈啾……确认物体「飞来」。\r\n虽无可奈何，但真令人困扰呢。\r\n无辜的「侵略者」。哈啾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52400d63d71627d27f0f7d1e2884458f61fc0798e96dd072b0b63327d6aab5eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f67ad849dd0a49c6933202",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小腿肚遭受攻击……\r\n这生物虽微小却很棘手呢。\r\n「蚊音」……在哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde085bc21190f53cc76dbce166f40ae0d56241a72de706e4057622dbffb9c81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b109e972aee664400f87ebbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧急状况，确认烟雾产生。\r\n准备「升空」──我想去拿\r\n那个「热呼呼」的东西……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a69dbc15f25af98ea19a15d801a7c259716aa2751706bc1def2e912d3ee11e66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dfb5674990369770fdd64a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "独自一人走在寒冷的夜里。\r\n四下无人，一片「寂静」。\r\n与航海家、隼鸟号……「对频」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb54e441af27878f97c858fbf00a18d03419268ace50a7efd05407faee09ef33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7519e7b4a66c927e1cb532cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“探査中”感取した“GDAE”…\r\nあの波長…『カンタービレ』は――\r\nふふ、サウンズオブアース…だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "456f79993084a54fa9c7067f2eec78f5263c7da6988e081ed8ae75ca76847b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8198423da43441a5b7b3ee6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自動ドア…『2人がかり』でも\r\n無反応…スティルインラブは\r\n“ニュートリノ仲間”だよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf2064548cd71fa845f987bbd41c9b1cdb133c35e1d39426053c2ee060b2a6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc249b58dee4d25b20d042d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“HAF”――『半分こ』、\r\n『好き』。味蕾の“同期”、\r\n“コネクト”できるから――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4cf6ba26ea385bdf19220d39b4db0ad3d96ac071b51faa082f32499dec1657d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18546b05d322887785f8a792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドゥラメンテ…六合への\r\n“センス”において“FSPY”――\r\n“観測点”で“遭遇”しがち…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2222dd5b2139a11d753f5a6f912c3f3380be0506ee759d9c1e3c63b7e329ca09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e413cf677d5554dea221c760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パパはよく“翻訳”考案してくれる\r\n――例示すると、\r\n“ネリュキルル”は『うきうき』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfc901e1761959ba1db5adf1293b46281086c8fa69f831fbf061b7039b3c56a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e666bea3f1d3d650fbef5242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“バード”も“オウル”も“可変”\r\n起床は、『得意』だよ――\r\n“宙芯時計”合わせれば『簡単』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a749d112fe61836650fc937e5086b51984694f6876efd04efa8af8a952eae9c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f9901f4284ce70d3f6f3971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『お団子』…ネオユニヴァースは\r\n豆腐を適用する『レシピ』採択を、\r\n強く、強く推奨――だよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65809b25246898c12951700c5759c18002a3ef87717f1826a462ef16b67641b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd933ee55a50204899b4d944",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『見えた』――“スペースサイン”\r\nあれは、ゼンノロブロイたちの――\r\n“F”“U”“J”…ふふ、そっか",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e11b4661a8dfdec4618a4fbbf61408923d6ba4e6508e5ec4fd3e994f956ce64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6873fb18f04472a5f7baa86c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“宇宙の窓”、開くからかな…？\r\n『声』、よく届くよ…『たのしい』\r\n…『うれしい』…『HHN』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "918a89f0e404128c20299dc694107c2986b49fbaed4ce046222de43145207cdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ec5f62d36d9c23b2cdd6ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『眼鏡』――UVも“バリヤー”\r\n可能の、『優れもの』。\r\nふふ…“識者”の選定、だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1c6a1b486d123d9256e2bafa3902a205e2cce98d1a0e792b3bfacf2e3a97b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb08e50bc9449e0c7ff0c3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鼻孔に“SMOK”――パターン、\r\nフジキセキが“推薦”の“YKMY”\r\n“リフトオフ”して確保、だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f63792849501402ae86aacf717534e0ef27b3ebbdf108cf128fd00484c1c9d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e70643f3fac386126f174f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…くしゅっ。トレーナー…\r\n希求――“夏につながるドア”。\r\n一緒なら、『見つかる』かも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51b2e656be92e0e4442294b507ca4fcaf1f5b5d5f6774eae966ad545796c60dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9405440b8cee11d539aa9e0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『ベレー帽』装着でも、\r\n“アンテナ”は“オープン”…\r\n“宙間波”、“阻害”するから――",
      "source_fingerprint": "472da4f61f17f19e4340066aa1bcedb831f03952b4dd9c4cc24070bed8e532be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e5e7e681bff5610a690f08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゼンノロブロイと\r\n“3と5”の装い…つまり\r\n――『ズッ友コーデ』だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa35914a826c040a4aae1dda7a9163692062c572d5ee966312db1e2a8a1813b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf0091bc6237be5dc0be39e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肯定。\r\n随时都可以开始哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea16af725b7153bfb2a5abf1c2c80bc7947efd7e06659e7fae09020a46ddc4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc1960cdb03a48caf5add33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“観測開始”、だね",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0810f302ce2a9701362489eb48d4a98da36a6ec2ff980b5c34fe8cf7b4f8ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed0ea1bcf8d38b2318eed09f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「训练」待机中。\r\n请给我「信号」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "795f108d54f9ac26d6f3ef91ea7be497621363aab307c64e30d84b371e2fc1de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff1e285fae61fd9c46a9ab00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "推进计划吧。\r\n新宇宙将完美「执行」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d71f3bb161e74f5400cce71948fd9001c70603070ab0b053c043b206c65cf5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0dd0fbb4e307a40c0dbe34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「MOLT」……\r\n新宇宙正感到「雀跃」，\r\n等不及脱胎换骨喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbe687e9580d156acc0752c7c3c6317a2f599a81d18332c92a344e3486e8497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f4b0f6ac65d027147f85ea7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你刚刚……「看见」了吗？\r\n是我多心了吗……如果我叫它的话，\r\n是否会再出现？呼叫～呼叫～",
      "source_fingerprint": "baea61695e55547b87416325d12fd3be4ba1caddf0fa8c64afcfd60e8fa6c881",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2c68d5fd09ea33e0ae8e3ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕因天色明亮而看不见，\r\n但却始终都高挂在那里。\r\n训练员，你就像星星一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7111000d550f3ad5f8bdaaa329a41e1a616353e334ac27cdb149f1b454597935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1060cb3bd8525d37f9ad84eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我「相信」训练员的理论。\r\n新宇宙会涂改现存法则，\r\n来「证明」这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5d27acfe80ff6a7118cb4e10eb1ca594386dda97af21e24c4650b2201996936",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6eaafacbe7a24a799e22f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沙丘……太阳亮度……\r\n可以期待环境带来的额外负荷。\r\n我想尝试不同以往的新挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab23cfd36468e8972b1f347609a3767996809884ae6546d84d41574e01d2cdb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385897845cdfd8b84bb1be81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロールアウト、オールグリーン。\r\n『いつでもどうぞ』だよ――\r\nオーバー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32ebcfb6e9ef2aec013a2d00f366864406f651799cceef72af6ae19af3080f29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c7b54029af8b35a4951d93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "3、2、1――…\r\n…？\r\n“打ち上げ”…待機？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d6960db32d39f78bbfcd05786bb6daf9b0c5dc2fa6e5cb83ac9a745139bae21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b13419ec7eb9968675c6c69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん…“窓”から…――\r\nピ、ピ、ピ、ピ…――\r\nふふ…『がんばれ』、だって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e558c0b77e9287a3845eb2fb255f60070d40c4acf4415e399f2e123016803d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beca5a69c7249d68a1b0d38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ツーツーツーツー、ツーツーツー\r\nツー、ツートンツートン、トン\r\nツー、ツートンツーツートン――",
      "source_fingerprint": "736d4a1465b069af48224af4c6037bea4439e2a4749d88741aba59be08801048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6faf53144b374d058ab78f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“MOLT”…“立ち上がる”\r\nしたい『気分』――“DNWY”\r\n…“振り落とさない”よ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cdfd9de5323da8ba159d0f8c5ea371bd46a3b70eee65dde0b4d3831ad9bc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a882979f0e585e15eda1a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“ボーナス食”、『多め』で持参。\r\n『がんばる』完了後、トレーナーと\r\n“HAF”したいから…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "254c79d37e3bb19ca7b4eeb64ac1fab5101f7b18b4e975d1318fc608da035177",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7c0214f6c8850aaa065070",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー、えっと…\r\n『いつもありがとう』。\r\nふふ…『伝える』、してみた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b7cbc1ee4571ea917f5a565e8d0af94fbc8634543608330b870a4c2d381eafd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bed279900c324423f77f91d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在广阔的宇宙中遇见了你。\r\n你始终与我一起走在「轨道」上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "06cd98f823ebfffb87ce438bb903deef43185006a0334c48aeaf2ee5636bb8ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4d414dd675a91c1dafa3c4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，「太空会合」很开心喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b445eb418cd4f5b7d00b1edd878e2985c83e8671846f2e16c5267dc4b16bc68f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f16efb369cdcf9c8d38cca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“心”、『伝える』できたかな――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f275e9690fafe5f6a61d315d21c67e6dc093789cb331e5233809fd0d9add858c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01bdf4cc71bcc5b7a4e9d84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スフィーラな『物語』だったよ、トレーナー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12f2d2053a4ba29886008ea4fd928f647d13a3d523ea8166268e95b2482d5bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e901ce0aae3b949c95e213d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即将进入「上升曲线」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d05af951aeb6ec32d520d776713a17a1d14cf23a0cbd7182f2eb56eaf29ff3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bead08dadef731fdab67ca3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「连结」至「高次元」……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ee65bd16fe9ef595c1b8a8e159dcf00196808ddd06b7c77ec1045da018f5a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a8818a1594fc59010dcce05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是新宇宙哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46826ab35fd6c6f947d9a027eec79cf1b10368d42ea39399ba30b3994672e5c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:437b9c83d48a971dcb218820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "三、二、一──「升空」。\r\n开始「对话」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4ed3707ec0633882543e64ea9beba0cedd4dbc2dc97b5b54254b8f885482dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bdefbb8c5062086fc97c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと押し上げられるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9836443d2b2a5fdf98f749399573665d54a961728f67a2828e016f43ad676c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:472d8af6cbf3b72837ee700c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高位へ推移したよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e58c6edfe74015f659a87eb591751cbe9cae6b5a3747a37bee1e3650280782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b869ecf0cd559c00944401c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アド・アストラ・ペル・アスペラ\r\n――だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15f4f2b9f6b2ce8a4e62dad405bafb45535344e79549ba8b46317f2042a8189d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ae938a5203cf8746c0ef693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "138億光年の先へ――",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a1b2db45c27b879db28352e3f2c4524e229c65d83f19521df430a545b10e3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf3caec97d3d90a52b77f27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幾億光年を超えて――\r\n『伝えたい』があるんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66dadfb1f3d17f37abfc2e155a927aca71bbd1caf93384f49356c66d9b806ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e652da9679a95abe55874e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネオユニヴァースと、\r\n『物語』“紐解く”をする？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f819a0c5b46f5f502032ed9dd2078005c174d78fe3c5abe020d98be840fc0e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1105",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44873a076f716c04503f408b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会试试！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6fe75069e7989f761bedcaedde6c898f706aa6fa5a332245266990cfa90f9e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44299c74e670d438251dfb89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自认算是个现实主义者。\r\n但却完全被卷进了一个\r\n不得了的世界呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd13f727f47eea1ee9f33cbb606cd4cb947d74da7daa09a276af975d995fe72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2724ef17c386f0ddbb5a30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきまーす。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eff9f881399edc4b05dfe13b5151d5ebefe40a90c1e15d37dca2c6c81f6f3d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c81370b01c2b04a2bf1d639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰りました～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe23e66d4456a703a48b8a6e2630111fe622741896302133d85bba87f247e370",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a6c80348b1c108d445649f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在想啊，听着训练员的指示时\r\n总觉得我好像被你牵着鼻子走……\r\n但现在说这个好像也太迟了吼～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1895925c1570d66794ba2fbeee2e42868b812dc37df02bad420db6e5dafb7af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c7877091072008d0e3994b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你我都这种步调\r\n真的好吗～？说是这么说，\r\n但我就是喜欢这种步调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61ca028d43540716758483d8380f50ed7aff90444d41dbc08d6f74c94aebddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953dd6ec6f2da1f8dd807af9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年当然就～是要悠闲度过啊。\r\n吃吃喝喝睡觉看电视玩手机……\r\n这才是所谓的新年礼仪哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5e111c99cb242980abe0c436c4839b1f826f5e0cbef5ea995ff7c2157db7f4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0171b02642b1e0f8668d3a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很期待能收到那个吗？\r\n我想一定很期待吧～？嗯～\r\n我姑且？算是有准备哦……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d267e634bce9b68ad0c0c2b8e2cfe28166c6bc7f7dc40168e1a6b56127202a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368698e0fdae9975ef4c81b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "亲手制作的巧克力啊～做起来\r\n意外地还挺辛苦的喔。所以呢……\r\n你可要心怀感～激地享用喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1885128f671b34a9b89dbfda7b39f0f0899dd1d6dc39fb6046b53fe613efb91b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdebea253c3f7492f5db4206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到七夕就想到许愿，\r\n但太贪心会遭报应吧？\r\n嗯……那我希望零用钱变多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "153c49ee92206baadf35b5ef820df09c028547ade93d89b4cfe0731f5eb0d630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145459980969bf21dc6dd60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别抢着去买万圣节限定的点心喔。\r\n像我一样等着买\r\n卖剩的点心才是专家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b45b79fc558645015e134028d632acdce89fee86d2a773bd0b0bd72944efc6ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250e6bf64d09004b3cbfedd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，圣诞节我有约在先了……\r\n我一直很想\r\n得意地说出这句话看看呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72b0be06d560fbca09e7a2939a82a6f61a4a77c16124390f1e774f8fe087789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945f9f1ca289bd21bd49c085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好棒喔～我很喜欢\r\n圣诞节装饰跟街上的气氛喔～\r\n要不要一起去感受呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c79a93aa4cb50e8adda956db49dccf20c481d44c169242c19c1ae58716bab112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a57591ac12cf5cbd15fc89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "613dae1fa0f9adf4924870c929bc20aacafcda48b809c6d3932fbccb808ea3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb56a4ec204a193f72d1d7bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也快过完了呢～\r\n得来预录一些感觉会很有趣的\r\n年末特别节目了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae7c72a11aa341f25518f1b0b558f88022121d7017cb0e18642a0dbb4885bd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:346109b9510196b61884eddd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我记得喔～\r\n今天是你生日吧？嘿嘿，\r\n去超市买盒大份量寿司吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "104caeb3514cf4a687d240dca30c6afb77728b0d6fe5118103cba180af89258f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4675dfa4ec19d11eb8b2f9ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐～！\r\n其实我还订了一个写着\r\n你名字的蛋糕……啊哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b5bfadcd68337a89d18e9cce4ee1670010d29199763ee8e823b6bcd2350ebb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d5b9659048a3d424338fec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想举办生日派对啦～\r\n在墙壁挂上圆形的那个……\r\n咦？那个叫什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f891f006cb3231fa495a350a957fb55779b8979c77b1d52744315a8a6f7c398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b39d1bb2293c13a9a0bd60d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考考你，今天是什么日子呢？\r\n……嘿嘿，是一年一度的奇迹日，\r\n也就是我的生日！耶耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "71eda92f7609aa611e9785763187098a01fe6dd9e6c58e123ab8e4e4fd918b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f86fe3f322bc45be1e12afda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦？有公告耶。\r\n……会不会是抽中奖品的通知呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d27ec77115c40a29bc198af2b03b7497df2a5b5c1ac6a0ddbd41161be3d7a247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a48f3ba17e4a173f784370cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～收到礼物啰。\r\n太好了太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9372b3a0664a14553132d7ae56cd15c3a285f1b1be83f8e8ac59f6505117ede6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a328429ce9059a77154d12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成所有任务～\r\n嘿嘿嘿，我故意说得像是游戏板词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bc8a2490baed782fe6aba709d5fdfb3ae77d58d497b18b82dd9d337eeab629c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d00ccf0a835664d7d149c2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～是活动！好像要举办活动了。\r\n总觉得会让人静不下心来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9246c3db4185a978a592a52e211fa3689946bd578082fab9bfd51ded9a09769",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b8aee108f2bba8eb63cf99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，这不是已经开始举办活动了吗！\r\n不知道什锦烧摊贩会不会来摆摊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a07e48d77e2f83f137092202eac2375549fd872cbd141b3c1eb7ce0ba1b7192",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "10019"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
